  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "1.缺失、錯誤。[例]誤差、差錯\n2.因比較而產生區別、不同。[例]差異、差別、相差很大\n3.不好的。[例]差勁、文筆很差\n4.尚、略、還。[例]差強人意\n5.數學上指兩數相減所得的數。[例] 3減1的差是2。\n6.欠缺、短少。[例]還差十分鐘就八點了。",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "4655",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.指使、派遣。[例]差遣、差使\n2.受派遣去做事的人。[例]欽差、郵差",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "4677",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.→參差\n2.等級。[例]尊卑之差、愛無差等",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5422",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "以兩手揉物或自相揉擦。通「搓」。[例]差沐",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5505",
      "verbatim": true
    }
  ]
